# This checkout runs with core.autocrlf=true (see
# docs/local-development.md#4-windows-specific-things-already-known-to-bite):
# on its own that would check these files out with CRLF line endings,
# which breaks them when run inside a Linux container/Git Bash (a
# Dockerfile with CRLF can fail to parse; a shebang script with a CRLF
# first line fails outright). Force LF regardless of the checkout
# platform's autocrlf setting.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
